{"seq":2,"slug":"brownian-motion","title":"布朗运动：原子真实存在的证明","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/core-contributions/quantum-and-statistical-physics/brownian-motion","wordCount":1279,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"布朗运动-原子真实存在的证明\">布朗运动：原子真实存在的证明</h1><p>1827 年，植物学家布朗（Robert Brown）在显微镜下观察到悬浮在水中的花粉颗粒在不停地、无规则地抖动。近八十年里，没人能解释这种永不停息的运动。1905 年 5 月，爱因斯坦递交了&quot;奇迹年&quot;的第二篇论文，用分子运动论给出了定量解释。这篇看似不如相对论耀眼的工作，实际上为一场旷日持久的科学争论画上了句号：原子和分子是真实存在的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>爱因斯坦的关键洞见是：悬浮颗粒的抖动，源于周围液体分子永不停息的热运动。无数水分子从各个方向随机撞击颗粒，在某一瞬间，来自某个方向的撞击偶然多于其他方向，颗粒便被推动一下。这种撞击的统计涨落，宏观上表现为颗粒的无规则游走。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[液体分子热运动] --&gt; B[随机撞击悬浮颗粒]&#10;    B --&gt; C[各方向撞击的统计涨落]&#10;    C --&gt; D[颗粒无规则游走 随机行走]&#10;    D --&gt; E[均方位移随时间线性增长]&#10;    E --&gt; F[可测量 → 验证分子存在]\">graph TD\n    A[液体分子热运动] --&gt; B[随机撞击悬浮颗粒]\n    B --&gt; C[各方向撞击的统计涨落]\n    C --&gt; D[颗粒无规则游走 随机行走]\n    D --&gt; E[均方位移随时间线性增长]\n    E --&gt; F[可测量 → 验证分子存在]</pre><p>下表说明这一解释为何具有决定性意义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>现象</td>\n<td>悬浮微粒的无规则永动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原因</td>\n<td>液体分子热运动的随机撞击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数学描述</td>\n<td>随机行走，均方位移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可测量</td>\n<td>扩散系数、阿伏伽德罗常数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>意义</td>\n<td>间接但定量地证实原子分子的存在</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"爱因斯坦的扩散方程\">爱因斯坦的扩散方程</h2><p>爱因斯坦没有去追踪单个颗粒每一次碰撞，而是转向统计描述。他证明，大量悬浮颗粒的均方位移（mean squared displacement）随时间线性增长：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle x^2 \\rangle = 2 D t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是扩散系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是时间。更进一步，他把扩散系数与可观测的物理量联系起来，得到著名的斯托克斯–爱因斯坦关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>η</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = \\frac{k_B T}{6\\pi \\eta r} = \\frac{R T}{6\\pi \\eta r N_A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是玻尔兹曼常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是温度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是液体黏度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是颗粒半径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是气体常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是阿伏伽德罗常数。这个公式的威力在于：它把肉眼可测的颗粒位移，与微观的阿伏伽德罗常数直接挂钩——只要测出颗粒的扩散，就能反推出一摩尔物质包含多少个分子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"佩兰的实验验证\">佩兰的实验验证</h2><p>爱因斯坦的理论提供了可证伪的定量预言，剩下的就交给实验。法国物理学家佩兰（Jean Perrin）在 1908—1909 年间，用精密的显微镜观测系统测量了悬浮颗粒的位移分布，验证了均方位移随时间线性增长的规律，并由此测出了阿伏伽德罗常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>23</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_A \\approx 6 \\times 10^{23}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">23</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，与其他独立方法的结果一致。</p>\n<p>佩兰的工作被广泛认为是&quot;原子存在&quot;的最终实证。在此之前，以马赫（Ernst Mach）、奥斯特瓦尔德（Wilhelm Ostwald）为代表的能量论者一直拒绝承认原子的实在性，认为它只是方便的计算工具。布朗运动的定量验证终结了这场争论。佩兰因此获得 1926 年诺贝尔物理学奖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"深远影响与现代应用\">深远影响与现代应用</h2><p>布朗运动的意义不止于一锤定音地确立原子论，它还开创了一整套数学与物理工具：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>随机过程理论</strong>：爱因斯坦的处理是随机行走与扩散过程的早期典范，后来由维纳（Norbert Wiener）发展为严格的&quot;维纳过程&quot;，成为随机微积分的基石。</li>\n<li><strong>涨落–耗散定理</strong>：斯托克斯–爱因斯坦关系把随机涨落（扩散）与耗散（黏滞阻力）联系起来，是涨落–耗散定理这一统计物理普遍原理的雏形。</li>\n<li><strong>跨学科渗透</strong>：布朗运动的数学模型今天广泛用于金融工程（如期权定价中的几何布朗运动）、生物物理（分子马达、细胞内输运）乃至信号处理中的噪声建模。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>布朗运动是液体分子热运动随机撞击悬浮颗粒的宏观表现。</li>\n<li>爱因斯坦给出均方位移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>D</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle x^2 \\rangle = 2Dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 与斯托克斯–爱因斯坦关系，把颗粒位移与阿伏伽德罗常数联系起来。</li>\n<li>佩兰 1908—1909 年的实验验证了理论并测出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，终结了关于原子是否真实存在的长期争论。</li>\n<li>这项工作还奠定了随机过程理论与涨落–耗散思想，影响延伸到金融、生物等众多领域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"photoelectric-effect\">光电效应：光量子假说的诞生</a>（同章兄弟篇）——同属 1905 奇迹年、同样用统计与微观图像解释宏观现象的工作。</li>\n<li><a href=\"bose-einstein-statistics\">玻色–爱因斯坦统计</a>（同章兄弟篇）——两者都是爱因斯坦统计物理思想的体现，从经典涨落到量子统计。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../../hubs/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-processes/martingale-brownian/brownian-motion\">布朗运动（随机过程）</a>（其它 hub）——爱因斯坦的物理处理如何被维纳抽象为严格的数学随机过程。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../../hubs/quantitative-finance/derivatives-pricing/pricing-foundations/stochastic-calculus\">随机微积分</a>（其它 hub）——几何布朗运动成为期权定价等金融工程的数学基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"布朗运动：原子真实存在的证明","id":"布朗运动-原子真实存在的证明"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"爱因斯坦的扩散方程","id":"爱因斯坦的扩散方程"},{"level":2,"text":"佩兰的实验验证","id":"佩兰的实验验证"},{"level":2,"text":"深远影响与现代应用","id":"深远影响与现代应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"光电效应：光量子假说的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/core-contributions/quantum-and-statistical-physics/photoelectric-effect"},"next":{"title":"玻色–爱因斯坦统计：预言一种新物态","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/core-contributions/quantum-and-statistical-physics/bose-einstein-statistics"}}